{"id":"6a4ad5688aac17fe","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md","title":"每层内部不可定义而高层可公理化低层真理","display":"thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy — 每层内部不可定义而高层可公理化低层真理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy","aliases":["91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy","91-thm-definability-hierarchy","91-thm-truth-definability-levels"],"display":"thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy — 每层内部不可定义而高层可公理化低层真理","depends_on":["[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy</span><span>91-thm-definability-hierarchy</span><span>91-thm-truth-definability-levels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy — 每层内部不可定义而高层可公理化低层真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{n+1}=\\mathcal L_n\\cup\\{T_n\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{n+1}=\\mathcal L_n\\cup\\{T_n\\}\\)</span> (分层语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\)</span> (第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层标准真理集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_n}(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n})\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_n}(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n})\\)</span> (在本层内部定义)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TB}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{TB}_n\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n\">\\(\\mathcal L_n\\)</span> 句子的去引号公理)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_n)\\)</span>\n(第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层语法可编码且支持对角引理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}definability\\text{-}hierarchy}\n\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_n)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\neg\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_n}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\,\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TB}_n\\vdash\nT_n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}definability\\text{-}hierarchy}\n\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_n)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\neg\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_n}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\,\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TB}_n\\vdash\nT_n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项由每层的 Tarski 对角论证得到。第二项说在更高语言中加入新谓词\n并配置去引号公理，可以公理化低层真理。</p>\n<p>仅把符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> 写进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{n+1}\\)</span> 不会自动“定义”任何集合；\n它的解释由模型与公理确定。更高层能谈论低层真理，也不意味着它能在\n自身语言内定义自己的全部真理，因而层级继续上升。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{n+1}=\\mathcal L_n\\cup\\{T_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_n}(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TB}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}definability\\text{-}hierarchy}\n\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_n)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\neg\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_n}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\,\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TB}_n\\vdash\nT_n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{n+1}","display":false}],"bytes"